            "name": "Email and password login",
            "body": "**As a** customer\n**I want** to log in with my email and password\n**So that** only I can see my accounts\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [x] Passwords are never shown or logged\n- [x] The error is the same for a wrong email and a wrong password",
