            "name": "Summary screen",
            "body": "The customer checks everything before any money moves.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [x] Shows the recipient's name and account number\n- [x] Shows the amount and the account it leaves\n- [x] **Edit** goes back with nothing lost\n- [x] Nothing is sent until **Confirm** is pressed",
            "url": "https://phabricator.com/test-company/T275",
            "status": "done",
            "points": 2,
            "tags": [
              "ux"
            ]
          }
        ],
