          },
          {
            "name": "SMS one-time code",
            "body": "Every transfer is confirmed with a code sent by text.\n\n1. The customer confirms the transfer\n2. We text a 6 digit code\n3. The code works **once**, for 5 minutes\n\n- [x] Three wrong codes cancel the transfer\n- [x] A new code can be asked for after 30 seconds",
            "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Payment_Services_Directive",
            "status": "done",
            "points": 3,
